WEBVTT

00:11:28.978 --> 00:11:32.163
♪ me faz sentir feia ♪

00:11:34.554 --> 00:11:37.560
♪ Tanta vergonha ♪

00:11:44.222 --> 00:11:47.496
♪ Gostaria de saber ♪

00:11:47.777 --> 00:11:51.161
♪ Há estrelas no inferno? ♪

00:11:51.361 --> 00:11:54.724
♪ Eu gostaria de saber ♪

00:11:54.987 --> 00:11:58.282
♪ saber se tu percebes ♪

00:11:58.591 --> 00:12:05.104
♪ que me fazes perder
tudo que conheço ♪